mapping "V5962.1" source="V5962" target="214031005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V5962 = Swedish extension of ICD-10 V59 (occupant of light truck/pick-up or van injured
        in collision with motor vehicle in a traffic accident) plus an activity-at-injury modifier
        (forvärvsarbete = paid work). The activity 7th character has no SNOMED CT representation, so the
        map captures only the vehicle/accident axis. The closest base ICD-10 V59 codes (V59.9
        unspecified occupant of pick-up truck/van in unspecified traffic accident; the V59.4-.9
        traffic-collision family) crosswalk in the Athena mirror to SNOMED CT 437165 (214031005) and 444074
        (36198007), both standard concepts. The Swedish code specifies a traffic collision, which the
        traffic-accident targets legitimately subsume; the dropped activity axis makes the map broader
        rather than exact.
        """
}
mapping "V5962.2" source="V5962" target="36198007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
}
mapping "V5963.1" source="V5963" target="214031005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V5963 = Swedish extension of ICD-10 V59 (occupant of light truck injured in collision
        with motor vehicle in a traffic accident) with activity modifier SNOMED CT 214031005 36198007
        (other activity). Same clinical accident/vehicle axis as V5962; only the activity-at-injury
        character differs. Base ICD-10 V59 traffic-collision codes crosswalk to SNOMED CT 437165 (Motor
        vehicle traffic accident) and 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident). Targets
        subsume the source (traffic accident context fully covered); the activity axis is dropped, so
        broader rather than exact.
        """
}
mapping "V5963.2" source="V5963" target="36198007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
